two tools, one goal: faster, safer rehab in water. 
 
The Fitness Capsule is a sealed, single-user hydrotherapy chamber with fresh water for every session – designed for post-op and immunocompromised patients who cannot share a pool but still need full-body water therapy. 
 
The modular rehabilitation pool handles everything else: group sessions, gait retraining, balance work, and athletic return-to-running, with a movable floor that lets therapists control load and depth in seconds. 
 
No concrete. No construction zone. Just plug clinical hydrotherapy into your existing space and start treating patients in days, not months. 
 
